  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the migration utils outputs the OCFL root directly in the output directory.  So if you specify \"output\" as your directory,  your migrated OCFL we live at output/ocfl-root .   This is inconvenient since Fedora 6 expects the directory structure under fcrepo.home to look like this:  <fcrepo.home>/data/ocfl-root.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task here is to update migration utils to output to the fcrepo home directory structure (fcrepo-home by default) ie (<output-dir:  fcrepo-home>/data/ocfl-root).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
