  "description": "<p>Currently the migration utils outputs the OCFL root directly in the output directory.  So if you specify \"output\" as your directory,  your migrated OCFL we live at output/ocfl-root .   This is inconvenient since Fedora 6 expects the directory structure under fcrepo.home to look like this:  &lt;fcrepo.home&gt;/data/ocfl-root.  </p>\n\n<p>The task here is to update migration utils to output to the fcrepo home directory structure (fcrepo-home by default) ie (&lt;output-dir:  fcrepo-home&gt;/data/ocfl-root).</p>",
